### Commande payée -> 201
POST http://localhost:3001/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId":"C-42","items":[{"sku":"CLAVIER","qty":2}]}

### Commande refusée (598 €) -> 402
POST http://localhost:3001/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId":"C-42","items":[{"sku":"ECRAN","qty":2}]}

### Relire la commande refusée -> 200
GET http://localhost:3001/orders/CMD-0002

### Produit inconnu -> 400
POST http://localhost:3001/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId":"C-42","items":[{"sku":"TELE","qty":1}]}

### Commande inexistante -> 404
GET http://localhost:3001/orders/CMD-9999
